WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:05.500
Mexico is a North American nation steeped in ancient Maya and Aztec civilizations.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:11.000
Pico de Orizaba, a stratovolcano, rises to 5,636 meters as Mexico's highest mountain summit.

00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:17.000
Chichén Itzá in Yucatán showcases the grand El Castillo pyramid built by Maya astronomers.

00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:23.000
Mariachi musical ensembles perform with violins, trumpets, vihuela, and the deep guitarrón.

00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:29.000
Authentic Mexican cuisine is UNESCO-inscribed, featuring corn tortillas, Mole poblano, and cacao.

